    id: 948, slug: 'net-api-versioning', title: 'API Versioning Strategies',
    description: 'Explore API versioning strategies — URL versioning, header versioning, and best practices for evolving APIs without breaking clients.',
    level: 'intermediate', duration: '35 min',
